OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 9 FEB
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GIan Skelly plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GLinton Stephens showcases the
OL,11,     Gbest performances from the UK and
OL,12,     Gbeyond, including soprano Sandra
OL,13,     GPiau live from Wigmore Hall and
OL,14,     GSaint-Saens's 3rd Violin Concerto
OL,15,     Gfrom Montpellier.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Schutz
OL,17,     GDonald Macleod delves into the
OL,18,     Gearly life of the great German
OL,19,     Gcomposer Heinrich Schutz, when
OL,20,     Gthe boy's musical talents were
OL,21,     Gdiscovered by an aristocrat.
