OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 9 FEB
OL,4,G1700FIn Tune
OL,5,     GKatie Derham welcomes the
OL,6,     GSitkovetsky Trio in studio for a
OL,7,     Glive performance, and live music
OL,8,     Gfrom jazz singers Emma Smith and
OL,9,     GNatalie Williams.
OL,10,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,11,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,12,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,13,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,14,     GThe BBC National Orchestra of
OL,15,     GWales and Principal Conductor
OL,16,     GRyan Bancroft perform Mahler, and
OL,17,     Gare joined by Johan Dalene in
OL,18,     GBrahms' Violin Concerto.
